cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ib15: code for the paper 'What 15-minute prices are worth to a battery in Spain'"
abstract: >-
  Builds a validated dataset of OMIE 15-minute day-ahead prices and archived
  weather forecasts, and computes the battery arbitrage value of 15-minute
  against hourly prices with perfect foresight and with forecasts made from
  public data at bid time.
authors:
  - family-names: Ezerzer
    given-names: Gabriel
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/GabrielEzerzer/iberian-battery-15min"
keywords:
  - electricity markets
  - battery storage
  - energy arbitrage
  - 15-minute prices
  - OMIE
  - price forecasting
